<title>UK: Average discount rate at UK bill tender 5.5136 pct.</title>
<headline>Average discount rate at UK bill tender 5.5136 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average rate of discount at the weekly tender of 91-day UK Treasury bills rose to 5.5136 percent from 5.4919 percent last week, the Bank of England said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 200 million stg offer attracted bids of 1.071 billion stg. The pro rata price was 98.625.</p>
<p>Next week, 200 million stg of bills will be on offer.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
